<title>USA: SpaceLabs increases share buyback.</title>
<headline>SpaceLabs increases share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>REDMOND, Wash. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>SpaceLabs Medical Inc said Monday its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to one million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the latest authorization is in addition to 165,100 shares remaining from a previous repurchase authorization.</p>
<p>As of the 1996 year end, SpaceLabs Medical had 9.8 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>&quot;We continue to see the repurchase of shares as a good investment for the company,&quot; said Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Carl Lombardi. &quot;Balanced against other needs for cash we anticipate continuing the program by purchasing our shares from time to time.&quot;</p>
</text>
